(7483001, 1190186, 86447, '<td valign="top">I always look at an image for the challenge topic, of course, but also how I like it outside of the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>This wins on the former (It fits the topic perfectly), but it doesn''t work at all for me as a photograph outside of the challenge.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this, but I''d have given it my lowest score, due to it not being a wonderful photograph on its own standing.<br/> <br/>However, I''m only one person... *grin*  And I''m only telling this to help you understand other people''s ideas, not to criticize.</td>', 'I always look at an image for the challenge topic, of course, but also how I like it outside of the challenge topic. This wins on the former (It fits the topic perfectly), but it doesn''t work at all for me as a photograph outside of the challenge. I didn''t vote on this, but I''d have given it my lowest score, due to it not being a wonderful photograph on its own standing. However, I''m only one person... *grin*  And I''m only telling this to help you understand other people''s ideas, not to criticize.', '2016-11-17 19:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
